        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "65"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "explanation": "Each newcomer’s score = (20 × 57 − 18 × 55) ÷ 2 = 75."
    },
    {
      "id": "05-108",
      "number": 108,
      "question": "The average of 4 numbers is 29. 3 numbers are 17, 26 and 39. Find twice the fourth number.",
